ized suit of armor to fight evil.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1300968,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games: Sunrise on the Reaping\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nzIXSQNgYZwFOMrmv0d0I3ulvkM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aqFZcr2dxSZ2UwWSo1WC6C0rwDf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Return to the world of Panem 24 years before Katniss Everdeen volunteers in her sister's place, commencing on the morning of the reaping of the 50th Hunger Games, also known as the Second Quarter Quell.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":969681,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bjiS5ipwxb9JFy3XRRN4OAilSeX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/subj7knTn4DeS6KS7qI66EQKe9i.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn't remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1423191,\"title\":\"Resident Evil\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gAgWJhUSQWCgtKR8170nMkYlBda.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3icyRAqgakNcQn6aDVz9libFmBA.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Medical courier Bryan unwittingly finds himself fighting for survival as one fateful, horrifying night collapses around him in chaos.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":687163,\"title\":\"Project Hail Mary\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iOb2fjXLbpJgyQXe46n1WtGCnaa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2I1OFQJ0L9T0dpU6FobKFWV2PxX.jpg\",\"rating\":8.6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Science teacher Ryland Grace wakes up on a spaceship light years from home with no recollection of who he is or how he got there. As his memory returns, he begins to uncover his mission: solve the riddle of the mysterious substance causing the sun to die out. He must call on his scientific knowledge and unorthodox ideas to save everything on Earth from extinction.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":299534,\"title\":\"Avengers: Endgame\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jtDv3lCnST0fZRvdYFwR5CVwK2x.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7RyHsO4yDXtBv1zUU3mTpHeQ0d5.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":157336,\"title\":\"Interstellar\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yQvGrMoipbRoddT0ZR8tPoR7NfX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8sNiAPPYU14PUepFNeSNGUTiHW.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The adventures of a group of explorers who make use of a newly discovered wormhole to surpass the limitations on human space travel and conquer the vast distances involved in an interstellar voyage.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":844041,\"title\":\"Kaizoku Sentai: Ten Gokaiger\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aLb9GEXbvEyiMdMHAXv4oTQXiVn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gDWT1IpMMmHAh3G1R4kNGlItARh.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ten years have passed since the defeat of the Zangyack Empire, and the Gokaigers have seemingly disbanded and gone their separate ways. On Earth, “Super Sentai Derby Colosseum” has become the hottest gambling venue ever, with various Super Sentai battling each other for charitable causes. Suddenly, Captain Marvelous appears, issuing a challenge to the Colosseum’s administration and those who work for them... including Gai Ikari!  Is it the Gokaigers or the people of Earth who have changed in the past ten years? And what of  Joe, Luka, Doc, and Ahim? After ten years, an extraordinary battle is about to begin…\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4538,\"title\":\"The Darjeeling Limited\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oSW5OVXTulaIXcoNwJAp5YEKpbP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hKJ513GbmTSmTXJU1uCXclh5Wkh.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three American brothers who have not spoken to each other in a year set off on a train voyage across India with a plan to find themselves and bond with each other -- to become brothers again like they used to be. Their \\\"spiritual quest\\\", however, veers rapidly off-course (due to events involving over-the-counter pain killers, Indian cough syrup, and pepper spray).\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":460516,\"title\":\"Filosofi Kopi 2: Ben & Jody\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3JCXWQdgepkKxK86drRh8tpViL2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3LeSCM2Xm24xVxv1ofpXTmUH8q7.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After starting their traveling coffee business, friends Ben and Jody reopen their shop in Jakarta, where new opportunities and challenges begin to brew.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":459974,\"title\":\"Everything Beautiful Is Far Away\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/71KHPoAOTeOiIpgelNkXCwSkU5p.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lAgGMwtpxQryb9AgKZ5n3ygnbFR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On an isolated desert planet, a man who is looking for parts to repair his robotic companion teams up with a young woman searching for an imaginary lake.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":843843,\"title\":\"Suddenly\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x5Xj72BQVNzk6lREDwNuYt4FLoX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mInqo4SQCjDgN5dDIJDa52UMETl.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ben and Laura are a passionate but volatile couple who embark on a round-the-world sailing adventure to give their relationship a new start. During their trip, they decide to explore a vast deserted island which they discover off the coast of Chile. Caught in a violent storm, they shelter in an abandoned whaling station for the night but wake up the next morning to find their boat has disappeared. Stranded in a hostile environment with no means of communication, dwindling supplies and winter approaching they must work together in a life and death battle for survival, that will challenge their feelings and change their relationship forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"U2Qp5pL3ovA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer 3\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"_YUzQa_1RCE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer 2\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Way9Dexny3w\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}